---
// Verbatim Authentic Content & Media from Khao Sok Riverside Cottages
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import GoogleReviewsWidget from '../../components/GoogleReviewsWidget.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Khao Sok Activities – Experience the wonder of Khao Sok"
  description="Khao Sok activities. Take a canoe trip, trek through the jungle and visit Cheow Lan lake. From a Khao Sok day tour to an overnight lake trip."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/khao-sok-national-park-2.jpg"
  heroTitle="Khao Sok Activities – Experience the wonder of Khao Sok"
  heroSubtitle="Curated Rainforest Adventures & Park Excursions"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Khao Sok Tours", "href": "/khao-sok-tours/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Activities</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          If you are staying at Riverside Cottages we can book a wide variety of activities for you. From a Khao Sok day tour to an overnight lake trip. Our activities fall into four categories. Choose your own adventure:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Lake trips</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Hiking and trekking</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Local adventures</a></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-culture/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thai culture</a></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          There is limited availability for many Khao Sok activities in the busy seasons. Book your Khao Sok trips in advance to avoid disappointment.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          You can book all your Khao Sok tours with reception when you arrive.<br /> For best results book a <span><a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors"><u>package</u></a></span> in advance.
        </p>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/khao-sok-national-park-2.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok lake"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok lake</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Lake Tours</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/#fulldaylake" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Full Day Cheow Lan Lake Tour</a></div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/#overnightcheowlan" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Overnight at the Lake</a></div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-lake-cheow-lan-tours/#private" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Private Overnight Lake Trips</a></div></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/jungle-hiking-1500-1000.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Jungle trekking and hiking"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Jungle trekking and hiking</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Hiking</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#half" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Half Day Hike</a> 700 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#full" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Full Day Hike</a> 1,400 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#night" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Night Safari</a> 700 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#daynight" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Jungle Day, Jungle Night</a> 1,600 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#flower" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Rafflesia – Giant Flower</a> Contact for price</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-trekking-hiking/#bang" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Bang Man Cave Hike</a> 1,800 THB</div></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/Khao-Sok-Canoe-Trip.jpg"
            alt="Khao Sok Thailand Adventure"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Khao Sok Thailand Adventure</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Local Adventures</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#canoetrip" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Canoe Trip</a> 750 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#tubing" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">River Tubing</a> 500 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#elephants" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Elephant Experience</a> 1,500 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#caverafthike" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Cave/Raft/Hike</a> 1,700 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#birdwatching" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Bird Watching</a> 1,700 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-adventures/#camping" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Jungle Camping</a> 3,000 THB</div></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <figure class="my-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-[#12281b]/10 bg-white/50">
          <img
            src="/wp-content/uploads/2015/09/Thai-Massage1.jpg"
            alt="Experience Thai Culture"
            class="w-full h-52 sm:h-72 md:h-80 object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
           width="1200" height="800" />
          <figcaption class="p-3.5 text-xs text-[#255038] font-serif italic border-t border-[#12281b]/10 bg-[#f4efeb]/60">Experience Thai Culture</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Thai Culture</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 my-6 pl-2">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-culture/#cooking" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thai Jungle Cooking</a> 1,500 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-culture/#massage" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Thai Massage</a> 600 THB</div></span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[#223e2c] text-base leading-relaxed">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#7a5813]/70 mt-2.5 flex-shrink-0"></span>
            <span><span class="icon-wrapper circle-no"><i class="fusion-li-icon fa fa-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div class="fusion-li-item-content"><a href="/khao-sok-thailand-culture/#hotsprings" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Hot Springs</a> 650 THB</div></span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>We know Khao Sok</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We know how to make your Khao Sok vacation memorable because we love exploring ourselves. This helps us suggest half-day hikes, day tours, longer treks, and overnight adventures. <a href="/khao-sok-2-day-tour/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok 2-day tours</a> are a popular choice.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Our knowledgeable and responsible guides help you make the most of your Khao Sok activities. If you do decide to visit Khao Sok you can get here easily from Surat Thani, Phuket, Krabi or Khao Lak. When you arrive, our activities will help you explore Khao Sok. You can enjoy early morning mist safaris and hikes to see amazing mountain views.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          SUPPORTING<br /> Environmental Sustainability<br /> & Social Responsibility
        </p>
        <div class="my-10 aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#12281b]/15 bg-black">
          <iframe
            class="w-full h-full"
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/LS2YIukmAzA?rel=0"
            title="YouTube video player"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
            allowfullscreen
            loading="lazy"
          ></iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          <a href="/khao-sok-videos/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Discover more videos here</a>
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Trips</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Maybe you are wondering <a href="/top-6-activities-in-khao-sok/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">what to do in Khao Sok</a>? From multi-day excursions, to a Khao Sok day tour, there are options for all! If you are looking for <a href="/khao-sok-family-holiday-thailand/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">family-friendly</a> Khao Sok activities with children, we have fantastic opportunities. If a laid-back, romantic getaway with your partner is more your style, we know just the right places.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Or, if deep-jungle adventures are what you are seeking, we can arrange tours to meet your needs and get the most from your Khao Sok trips. For best results booking your Khao Sok national park tour to Cheow Lan lake we recommend booking one of our <a href="/khao-sok-tour-packages/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">tour packages</a>.
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Thoughts from our Guests</span>
        </h2>
        <!-- Luxury Booking CTA Card -->
        <div class="my-12 p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-[#12281b] text-white shadow-2xl border border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#ba9038] font-semibold">Reserve Your Experience</span>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-white font-semibold mt-1">Ready to Book this Experience?</h3>
              <p class="text-[#abd0bb] text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-xl">
                No deposit required — book directly with our honor system guarantee. Free private shuttle pickup from the Khao Sok bus stop included.
              </p>
            </div>
